  "body": "The Last Blank Canvas in Okoromai Views - Vendor Demands Sale\r\n\r\nStop searching for the perfect home - design it exactly how you want. Tucked away in one of Gulf Harbour's most exclusive and established enclaves, 15 Okoromai Views offers a massive 814m² (more or less) of freehold, elevated land surrounded by multi-million-dollar architectural residences.\r\n\r\nProperty Features:\r\n\r\n• Generous 814m² (more or less) Freehold Site: Expansive elevated land with stunning outlooks over Okoromai Bay.\r\n\r\n• Protected Investment: Surrounded by completed high-end designer homes, ensuring your future build is protected by quality neighborhood covenants.\r\n\r\n• Premium Coastal Lifestyle: A short distance to regional parks, local golf courses, beaches, and the ferry terminal for an easy commute to Auckland CBD.\r\n\r\nImportant Infrastructure Note:\r\nPlease note that due to strict local Watercare network capacity management in the area, there is currently no active water connection to the site. Final connection approval is subject to Council building consent submission and infrastructure availability.\r\n\r\nThe vendors welcome standard 15-day conditional offers, allowing your building company or architect the opportunity to verify connection viability alongside your proposed house design.\r\n\r\nThe vendors want this sold. All written offers will be presented immediately. \r\nContact Olga today for the full Info Pack and Title details.",
